00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.980
Hokuto City, in Yamanashi Prefecture...

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.850
Beyond the Koshu Highway at the bottom
of the hill from Hinoharu Station,

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:45.350
which is on the Chuo Main Line,
there is a gradual incline.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.770
I have no parents.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:54.810
No money, either.
Nor do I have any hobbies,

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:59.190
anyone I can call a friend,
or any goals for the future.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.810
Yes, I...

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:13.940
Super Cub

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:13.940
Episode 1

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:13.940
The Girl with Nothing

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.950
2nd Year

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:32.060
All right, good morning.
Let's see, any absences...?

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:35.560
No, there aren't. Okay, then...

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.460
{=1}That acts to connect

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:41.940
They knew that they could go
anywhere with the motorcycle.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:46.560
That's why they said happily
where to go tomorrow.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.020
Hey, did you see that show
last night? It was so good--

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.640
"Chukadon"

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.400
You know what? I do nothing but
watch videos on the net every night,

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.100
and I found this girl I'm a big fan of.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.270
Get this, she's in Hokkaido--

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.450
"Crea Scoopy"

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.020
Too much.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:50.470
{=2}Monkey125

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.690
Are you here shopping?

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:58.690
I thought I wanted a scooter, but it looks
like I don't have nearly enough money.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:01.980
Hmm, perhaps a used one will do.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.520
Huh?

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:40.690
Um, I really have no money.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.100
It's 10,000 yen.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.270
I'll... take it.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.730
Why is it only 10,000 yen?

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:28.440
Some people got killed.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.850
Three of them.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:30.900
I don't mind.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.600
Huh?

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.310
I'll buy it.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.980
Come inside.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:46.230
Fill out your name
and address here and here.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.670
Koguma

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:58.270
I don't... have a license.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.900
"Motor Scooter Licensing"

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:09.020
The test questions never change.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.480
Th-Thank you very much.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.940
Do you have a helmet and gloves?

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:05.940
Yes, I brought them.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.100
Just a moment.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.150
Here, take these.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.520
How many people did these kill?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.730
Hmm, they're brand new.

