00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:49.650
Once you've put a hundred kilos on it,
bring it back for an oil change.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:54.310
Doing so will extend the engine
life of these used ones.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.520
Okay.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:58.560
I'll put this in here for you.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:16.190
Release the handlebar lock
and turn the key on.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:18.560
Then, give the pedal a kick.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.520
All right.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.690
You'll have to kick harder
than that to start it.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:04.600
Those are the basics of how
it works. Now, give it a try.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:11.350
Before kicking, gradually move
the pedal with my foot...

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:14.900
...and find the place
where it starts to push back.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.900
Put it in first gear...

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:41.900
Thank you very much.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:08.980
A keychain... I'll have to go
to the hardware store.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:12.690
Oh, yeah, on my Cub.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:40.600
I should hurry and get
so I can ride it better, huh?

