00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:40.980
Be strong.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:11.400
Gradually move the pedal with my foot...

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.850
...and find the place
where it starts to push back.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.350
Why?

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.520
What's wrong?

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:45.900
Huh?

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:48.310
Are you not feeling okay, or something?

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:51.480
Oh, no, I'm fine.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.020
Well, it's getting late.
Be careful heading home.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.020
Oh, sure.

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.770
I'll put this in here for you.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.140
{=10}Owner's Manual

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:30.520
"When the engine won't start"...

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.560
Page 89!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:39.400
"Is there fuel in the gas tank?"

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.810
Gasoline...

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.620
Gasoline

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.620
Refuel

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.620
Full

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.560
The fuel petcock...

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:58.060
"RES"...

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:00.100
"Reserve fuel"!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.940
"Remove the gas tank cap,

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:09.190
and fill gasoline through the inlet to
the lower edge of the filler neck."

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:32.770
I made it... home...

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:15.520
Good.

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:24.150
"Do not warm up the engine for too long."

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:31.600
Is that... long enough?

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:40.440
It costs just over 500 yen
to fill the tank.

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:44.560
On the Chuo Main Line, that would
be about enough to get to Kofu.

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:51.600
Up until yesterday,
I didn't have anything.

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:56.480
But... starting today, I have my Cub.

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:07.230
I wonder how far my Cub will take me.

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:19.890
Reiko

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:19.890
Super Cub

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:19.890
Episode 2

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:19.730
Episode 2: "Reiko."
